---
import Verticalgrid from "../assets/Verticalgrid.astro";
---

<section class="">
<Verticalgrid />
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl py-8 lg:px-16 md:px-12 px-8 xl:px-18 items-center lg:py-[72px] relative w-full">
    <div class="mx-auto text-center">
      <h2 class="">Key Features Enabled by the Integration</h2>
      <!--<p class="max-w-4xl mx-auto mt-4">Points, VIP, referrals, gift cards, and store credit work seamlessly together to create the ultimate rewards program for your business.</p>-->
    </div>
    <div class="mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-14 mt-10">
     <div class="flex flex-col p-[0.060rem] bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-gray-100">
        <div class="p-6">
          <div class="grid items-center justify-center w-full grid-cols-1 text-left">
            <div>
              <img alt="Shopify gift cards" class="text-center" width="176" height="176" loading="lazy" src="/assets/shopify/Shopify-GC.svg">
              <p class="text-xl font-medium mt-8">Gift Card Support</p>
              <p class="mt-2">Customers can purchase, store, and redeem 99minds gift cards directly in your Appbrew-powered app. Gift card balances are synced in real-time between Shopify, 99minds, and the mobile app.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
       
          
        
      </div>
     <div class="flex flex-col p-[0.060rem] bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-gray-100">
        <div class="px-6 py-8 sm:p-10 sm:pb-6">
          <div class="grid items-center justify-center w-full grid-cols-1 text-left">
            <div>
              <img alt=" Shopify loyalty program" class="text-center" width="176" height="176" loading="lazy" src="/assets/shopify/Shopify-LP.svg">
              <p class="text-xl font-medium mt-8"> Loyalty & Rewards</p>
              <p class="mt-2 ">Display loyalty points in the user dashboard. Customers can view available rewards and redeem points on checkout. Loyalty logic (earn/redeem rules) is powered by 99minds but rendered in-app via Appbrew’s native UI.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
       
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col p-[0.060rem] bg-white shadow-xl border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl">
        <div class="px-6 py-8 sm:p-10 sm:pb-6">
          <div class="grid items-center justify-center w-full grid-cols-1 text-left">
            <div>
              <img alt=" Shopify store credit" class="text-center" width="176" height="176" loading="lazy" src="/assets/shopify/Shopify-SC.svg">
              <p class="text-xl font-medium mt-8">Promo Codes & Discounts</p>
              <p class="mt-2">Customers can apply 99minds-generated promo codes during checkout. Appbrew supports deep linking and banners for campaigns triggered by 99minds.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
       
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col p-[0.060rem] bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-gray-100">
        <div class="px-6 py-8 sm:p-10 sm:pb-6">
          <div class="grid items-center justify-center w-full grid-cols-1 text-left">
            <div>
              <img alt=" Shopify referral program" class="text-center" width="176" height="176" loading="lazy" src="/assets/shopify/Shopify-Rf.svg">
              <p class="text-xl font-medium mt-8">Customer Segmentation & Personalization</p>
              <p class="mt-2">Leverage 99minds' segmentation tools to target customers based on purchase behavior, demographics, or engagement. Personalized offers and campaigns are delivered through Appbrew's native UI for a seamless in-app experience.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
       
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col p-[0.060rem] bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-gray-100">
        <div class="px-6 py-8 sm:p-10 sm:pb-6">
          <div class="grid items-center justify-center w-full grid-cols-1 text-left">
            <div>
              <img alt=" Shopify coupons" class="text-center" width="176" height="176" loading="lazy" src="/assets/shopify/Shopify-CG.svg">
              <p class="text-xl font-medium mt-8">Real-Time Analytics & Insights</p>
              <p class="mt-2">Track user engagement, redemptions, and campaign performance across gift cards, loyalty, and promos. 99minds analytics sync with Appbrew dashboards, offering actionable insights within your mobile app environment.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col p-[0.060rem] bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-gray-100">
        <div class="px-6 py-8 sm:p-10 sm:pb-6">
          <div class="grid items-center justify-center w-full grid-cols-1 text-left">
            <div>
              <img alt="Shopify pos" class="text-center" width="176" height="176" loading="lazy" src="/assets/shopify/Shopify-POS.svg">
              <p class="text-xl font-medium mt-8">Omnichannel Synchronization</p>
              <p class="mt-2">Ensure consistency across online store (Shopify), mobile app (Appbrew), and backend logic (99minds). All customer activities—whether done on the website or app—are reflected in real-time across platforms.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
       
    </div>
  </div>
   <div class="flex flex-col justify-center max-w-xl gap-2 mx-auto sm:flex-row">
   <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2 lg:mt-10">
          <a href="https://apps.shopify.com/99minds-gift-card-loyalty-referral#" target="_blank" class="raise1 relative p-0.5 inline-flex items-center justify-center font-bold overflow-hidden group rounded-md font-medium">
                <span class="w-full h-full bg-black absolute"></span>
                <span class="relative px-4 py-2 transition-all ease-out bg-gray-900 bg-opacity-0 rounded-md group-hover:bg-opacity-10 duration-400">
                <span class="relative text-white">Install 99minds on Shopify</span>
                </span>
          </a>
      </div>
      </div>
</section>
